Bundled third-party components
------------------------------

  lib/*.dll
      Reference assemblies auto-generated (via Refasmer) from Oxygen Not
      Included and third-party libraries shipped with it. Metadata only — they
      compile but cannot execute. See lib/LICENSE.txt.

  src/UtilLibs/
      Vendored helper library from SGT_Imalas' ONI mod collection, ILRepacked
      into the mod assembly. Covered by the MIT grant in LICENSE.

  src/UtilLibs/UI/FUI/Unity_UI_Extensions/
      Unity UI Extensions. See that directory's LICENSE.md.

  src/BlueprintsIncluded/ModAssets/assets/*/blueprints_ui
      Unity AssetBundles holding the mod's UI prefabs, built by this project in
      dytterud/oni-blueprints-ui from a layout extracted from SGT_Imalas'
      BlueprintsV2 while it was MIT licensed. They contain no code, only stock
      Unity UI and TextMeshPro components, 22 icons carried under that MIT grant,
      and white placeholders for Oxygen Not Included's own sprites, which the mod
      swaps in from the game at load. No Klei art or font ships in them.
      Provenance: docs/blueprints-included/asset-provenance.md.

  src/BlueprintsIncluded/ModAssets/License_Blueprints.txt
      Licence text shipped with the mod's assets.
